.\" pngimage has no man page or --help. Written from the option parsing in
.\" libpng contrib/libtests/pngimage.c (main) and the comments on its flags.
.TH PNGIMAGE "1" "" "libpng" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pngimage \- read PNG files with combinations of libpng transforms and check the results
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pngimage
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIFILE\fR...
.SH DESCRIPTION
For each file on the command line, pngimage reads it with a range of libpng
transforms and checks the results. Later options override earlier ones.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR
Set the reporting level to verbose. Overrides \fB\-\-warnings\fR, \fB\-\-errors\fR and \fB\-\-quiet\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-warnings\fR
Set the reporting level to report warnings. Overrides \fB\-\-verbose\fR, \fB\-\-errors\fR and \fB\-\-quiet\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-errors\fR
Set the reporting level to report errors only. Overrides \fB\-\-verbose\fR, \fB\-\-warnings\fR and \fB\-\-quiet\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-quiet\fR
Set the reporting level to quiet. Overrides \fB\-\-verbose\fR, \fB\-\-warnings\fR and \fB\-\-errors\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-exhaustive\fR
Test all combinations of active transforms. Cannot be used with \fB\-\-fast\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-fast\fR
Do not test all combinations of active transforms. Cannot be used with \fB\-\-exhaustive\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-strict\fR
Fail on warnings as well as errors. Cannot be used with \fB\-\-relaxed\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-relaxed\fR
Fail on errors only. Cannot be used with \fB\-\-strict\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-log\fR
Log pass/fail to stdout. Cannot be used with \fB\-\-nolog\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-nolog\fR
Do not log pass/fail. Cannot be used with \fB\-\-log\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-continue\fR
Continue with the next file after a failure. Cannot be used with \fB\-\-stop\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-stop\fR
Stop at the first failure. Cannot be used with \fB\-\-continue\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-bugs\fR
Skip over known bugs. Cannot be used with \fB\-\-test\-all\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-test\-all\fR
Do not skip over known bugs. Cannot be used with \fB\-\-skip\-bugs\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-log\-skipped\fR
Log skipped bugs; only has an effect together with \fB\-\-skip\-bugs\fR. Cannot be used with \fB\-\-nolog\-skipped\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-nolog\-skipped\fR
Do not log skipped bugs. Cannot be used with \fB\-\-log\-skipped\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-find\-bad\-combos\fR
Attempt to deduce bad combinations of transforms. Cannot be used with \fB\-\-nofind\-bad\-combos\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-nofind\-bad\-combos\fR
Do not attempt to deduce bad combinations of transforms. Cannot be used with \fB\-\-find\-bad\-combos\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-list\-combos\fR
List combinations of transforms by name. Cannot be used with \fB\-\-nolist\-combos\fR.
.TP
\fB\-\-nolist\-combos\fR
Do not list combinations of transforms by name. Cannot be used with \fB\-\-list\-combos\fR.
